{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3764490/extras/1.jpg?t=1748072588\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Witch Play House</strong>\u00a0is an unconventional fantasy collection-adventure game that seamlessly blends exhilarating monster-slaying action with a deep collection system. The game features a unique &quot;aesthetic of feet&quot; theme, creating a mysterious world brimming with whimsical imagination.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3764490/extras/2.jpg?t=1748072588\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Easy to Pick Up, Hard to Put Down</strong><br>Simple and intuitive gameplay with a low skill ceiling.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3764490/extras/8.jpg?t=1748072588\" />\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Massive Collection Elements</strong><br>Hundreds of stylish outfits, accessories, and bizarre artifacts await discovery, along with exclusive character story illustrations to unlock.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3764490/extras/10.jpg?t=1748072588\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Unique Visual Experience</strong><br>An unusual art style\u2014from monsters to environments, everything is filled with unexpected designs, where you\u2019ll encounter fantastical creatures beyond imagination.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3764490/extras/3.jpg?t=1748072588\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Affinity System</strong><br>Build relationships to unlock character-specific storylines, each with their own bizarre and intriguing tales.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This is no ordinary RPG!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3764490?t=1748072588","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3764490/4fd1e7ab0a42ef68fc108ea73c07b45d5b786aeb/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1748072588","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3764490/5fa96c35009cb9059aef40790e0eded07219cdd7/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1748072588","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3764490/5fa96c35009cb9059aef40790e0eded07219cdd7/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1748072588","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3764490/extras/1.jpg?t=1748072588\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Witch Play House</strong>\u00a0is an unconventional fantasy collection-adventure game that seamlessly blends exhilarating monster-slaying action with a deep collection system. The game features a unique &quot;aesthetic of feet&quot; theme, creating a mysterious world brimming with whimsical imagination.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3764490/extras/2.jpg?t=1748072588\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Easy to Pick Up, Hard to Put Down</strong><br>Simple and intuitive gameplay with a low skill ceiling.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3764490/extras/8.jpg?t=1748072588\" />\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Massive Collection Elements</strong><br>Hundreds of stylish outfits, accessories, and biza